  /// The severity of a security control. For more information about how
  /// Security Hub CSPM determines control severity, see Assigning severity to
  /// control findings in the Security Hub CSPM User Guide .
  pub severity_rating: SeverityRating? = None
  /// Specifies whether a security control is available in the current Amazon
  /// Web Services Region.
  pub current_region_availability: RegionAvailabilityStatus? = None
  /// Security control properties that you can customize. Currently, only
  /// parameter customization is supported for select controls. An empty array
