  pub product: Float? = None
  /// The severity value of the finding. The allowed values are the following.
  /// INFORMATIONAL - No issue was found. LOW - The issue does not require
  /// action on its own. MEDIUM - The issue must be addressed but not
  /// urgently. HIGH - The issue must be addressed as a priority. CRITICAL -
  /// The issue must be remediated immediately to avoid it escalating.
